layout: template.njk
slug: estimate-roofing
title: Estimate form for roofers (free PDF) | Jobchit
description: A free, printable roofing estimate form. Roof area and pitch, tear-off layers, roofing product, underlayment, flashing, ventilation, decking allowance, line items and total, with a line for the customer to sign. No account needed.
heading: Estimate for roofing
sub: Roof area, tear-off, materials, flashing and ventilation on one page, with line items, a total and a line for the customer to sign when they say yes.
tips:
  - Write the roof area in square feet and the pitch, and note any steep or hard-to-reach sections.
  - Say how many layers come off and who hauls the old roofing away.
  - Name the roofing product and color, plus underlayment, flashing, pipe boots and ventilation.
  - Say how bad decking is priced if it turns up during tear-off, for example per sheet. That keeps a surprise from becoming an argument.
  - Put a date the price is good until. When the customer agrees, have them sign and date it, and keep a copy each.
---
